**The thesis.** Burr is typed Enneagram 6 (sp-dominant, 6w7), and the argument runs on his own tape rather than assertion. He has given the same origin story three times across eight years — THR 2022, Tim Ferriss 2017, and a voice-over inside his own 2025 Hulu special — each time saying he became a comedian so people would like him "so that no one would hurt me."

**The evidence that makes the page.** The entity-gap packet said the moat is nineteen years of first-person podcast that no competitor mines. I pulled three 2026 Monday Morning Podcast transcripts directly and found the tiebreaker: Burr describes the *same Riyadh gig* two ways eleven months apart. On Conan's stage in October 2025 he called critics "sanctimonious c***s" and showed zero fear. On his own show on 2026-08-10, with nobody watching, he reports "dry mouth for like the first 20 minutes" and getting nervous "anytime anybody even moved." That two-date ledger is the bespoke section form and the empathy turn.

